<title>SWEDEN: Skandia posts six pct rise in 9 mo profit.</title>
<headline>Skandia posts six pct rise in 9 mo profit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurer Skandia reports for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>			     (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit			  2,767 vs   2,618</p>
<p> Net Asset Value			  18,140 vs  16,249*</p>
<p> Net Asset Value per share (SKR)	 177 vs     159*</p>
<p>TECHNICAL RESULT</p>
<p> Non-life insurance, reinsurance	 214 vs   898</p>
<p> Life and unit linked assurance	  515 vs   106</p>
<p> Life reinsurance		     LOSS  13 vs    55  PROFIT</p>
<p> Life assurance				502 vs   161</p>
<p>INVESTMENT INCOME</p>
<p> Non-life insurance, reinsurance     1,993 vs 1,624</p>
<p> Life insurance, non-technical	    61 vs    34</p>
<p> Joint group expenses			625 vs   746</p>
<p> Non-technical profit		    1,429 vs   912</p>
<p>Change in value of unit linked</p>
<p>  business in force			  582 vs   642</p>
<p> Other activities			     40 vs     5</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			    2,185 vs 1,976</p>
<p> Tax					     676 vs   696</p>
<p> Minority interests			  100 vs    44</p>
<p> Net profit				  1,409 vs 1,236</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Swedish insurer is Skandia Insurance Company Limited.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
